{
  "$about": "The v2 icon set (Icons page, design/foundations/iconography.md). icons: every icon v2 uses, by name; components ask for these names, never for a file. src = tabler (node_modules/@tabler/icons, outline; the default, scaled to Lucide's size by src/lib/icons.ts) or lucide (node_modules/lucide-static), with 'file' when the library's name differs from ours, own (public/icons/<name>.svg, our drawing or a kept live one), tool (public/logos/tools/<name>/icon.svg). style = line (default) or solid. status = proposed -> approved, as each is reviewed. live: every icon on openmined.org's style guide (src/pages/icons/_live-icons.json) and the set icon that replaces it (null = none yet; the live drawing stays). match: exact, close, none, status, tool, gap. To change an icon: edit its entry here, or add a drawing with npm run icons:import. Read by src/lib/icons.ts; a name missing here fails the build.",
